#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:5 fdf34b58ebb04608a555a9141182dd12
msgid "SITL with Webots"
msgstr "SITL 与 Webots"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:7 22d0e839870349b78359c6b03482c9da
msgid ""
"`Webots <https://cyberbotics.com/>`__ is a multi-platform robotics simulator"
" that has been in development since 1998 and is designed for professional "
"use. ArduPilot has both Multirotor and Rover examples and supports the "
"creation of new vehicles and worlds. As of writing, there is no fixed-wing "
"support as it will require a custom `physics plugin "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/physics-plugin>`__ to simulate lift."
msgstr ""
"`Webots <https://cyberbotics.com/>`__ "
"是一款多平台机器人仿真器，自1998年起持续开发，专为专业用途设计。ArduPilot 提供了多旋翼和 Rover "
"示例，并支持创建新的飞行器和仿真世界。截至撰写本文时，尚不支持固定翼，因为这需要自定义 `物理插件 "
"<https://cyberbotics.com/doc/reference/physics-plugin>`__ 来模拟升力。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:14 2941dc2fdb614844898d09d0746fc40a
msgid ""
"Currently, there are two ArduPilot Webots robot controller implementations: "
"a python-based controller and a C-based controller."
msgstr "目前，ArduPilot Webots 机器人控制器有两种实现：基于 Python 的控制器和基于 C 的控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:25 38270458895049fba7401591ab74bb17
msgid "Webots Python"
msgstr "Webots Python"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:26 65813f5c7bd84466bce5b1d009225f54
msgid ""
"The Webots python controller is the newer implementation of the two options "
"and supports the newest Webots versions (2023a and onwards). It was designed"
" to run without compilation on all operating systems while providing an easy"
" way to create custom vehicles and worlds."
msgstr ""
"Webots Python 控制器是两种选项中较新的实现，支持最新的 Webots 版本（2023a "
"及之后版本）。它设计为在所有操作系统上无需编译即可运行，同时提供了创建自定义飞行器和仿真世界的简便方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:37 d65d5d68b2184866904ec5ca1a6bc669
msgid "Webots C"
msgstr "Webots C"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-webots.rst:38 5a7c8773bce746d9ac68a72fed665295
msgid ""
"The Webots C controller was the first Webots implementation in ArduPilot and"
" supports Webots 2021b. This implementation also includes wind simulation "
"through a custom physics plugin."
msgstr ""
"Webots C 控制器是 ArduPilot 中第一个 Webots 实现，支持 Webots "
"2021b。该实现还通过自定义物理插件包含风场仿真功能。"
